    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0ALLGO: The Prime Reset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Upgrade. Die. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALLGO: The Prime Reset is a fast-paced, high-intensity shooter that blends <strong>first-person and third-person combat</strong> with <strong>roguelite progression</strong>. Designed for solo play (with <strong>co-op coming soon</strong>), you'll face brutal <strong>waves of enemies</strong> across dynamic arenas as you unlock new weapons, gear, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a collapsing world where you must <strong>monitor your inventory</strong>, <strong>re-arm between rounds</strong>, and strategically build your loadout to survive just one more wave. Each run gets you closer to mastering the battlefield\u2014until you're reset to do it all over again, stronger and smarter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Single-player action (co-op mode launching soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Switch between First- and Third-Person views</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Endless Wave-Based Combat with escalating difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Tactical Roguelite Progression \u2013 upgrade, adapt, and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Inventory &amp; Gear System to manage your arsenal mid-battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Gamepad support and tight, responsive gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Replay-focused loop: Fight, Upgrade, Die, Repeat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive The Prime Reset?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0ALLGO: The Prime Reset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Upgrade. Die. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALLGO: The Prime Reset is a fast-paced, high-intensity shooter that blends <strong>first-person and third-person combat</strong> with <strong>roguelite progression</strong>. Designed for solo play (with <strong>co-op coming soon</strong>), you'll face brutal <strong>waves of enemies</strong> across dynamic arenas as you unlock new weapons, gear, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a collapsing world where you must <strong>monitor your inventory</strong>, <strong>re-arm between rounds</strong>, and strategically build your loadout to survive just one more wave. Each run gets you closer to mastering the battlefield\u2014until you're reset to do it all over again, stronger and smarter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Single-player action (co-op mode launching soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Switch between First- and Third-Person views</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Endless Wave-Based Combat with escalating difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Tactical Roguelite Progression \u2013 upgrade, adapt, and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Inventory &amp; Gear System to manage your arsenal mid-battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Gamepad support and tight, responsive gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Replay-focused loop: Fight, Upgrade, Die, Repeat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive The Prime Reset?</p>",
